<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakhstan auctions 550 mln tenge bills May 13.</title>
<headline>Kazakhstan auctions 550 mln tenge bills May 13.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan will auction 550 million tenge of three-month MKM discount Treasury bills on May 13, the National Bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Full details of the issue:</p>
<p>    Series number		  KZ43K1408972</p>
<p>    Issue volume		   550 million tenge</p>
<p>    Denominations		  100 tenge</p>
<p>    Tenor			    91 days</p>
<p>    Issue date		     May 13, 1997</p>
<p>    Maturity date		  Aug 14, 1997</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
